  "notes": "Input 1 is a front 6.35 mm jack for line or instrument (Inst button); Input 2 is the rear XLR mic input. The speaker outputs and the headphone output share the same feed. Kensington lock not listed. Routing: inputs reach the computer via USB and the outputs via direct monitoring; computer playback reaches the speaker and headphone outputs. Controls from the user guide, 'Front Panel': gain for input 1 (line/instrument) and input 2 (mic), INST, 48V, AIR, speaker output level, DIRECT MONITOR on/off and headphone level. Inputs reach the speaker and headphone outputs only with DIRECT MONITOR on. Assumption: output levels at MIN are silent.",
